{
 "name": "M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 1, Section E  - Requests for Field Examinations",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000178000\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 1, Section D  - Regional Office (RO) Hearings\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000178000?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000178002\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 2, Section A  - Evaluating a Pending Claim When a Veteran Returns to Active Duty\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000178002?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><h2><a id=\"top\" name=\"top\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Overview</span></span></strong></a></h2><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>In This Section</strong></span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This section contains the topic \"<a href=\"#1\">Field Examinations</a>.\"</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><p></p><h2><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; Field Examinations</span></span></strong></h2><p><br />&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information on requesting field examinations, including</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">when to request a field examination</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1b\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">how to request a field examination</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1c\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">handling requests for medical, social, or industrial history</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1d\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">facilitating identification of&nbsp;a person concerned in a claim</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1e\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">routing field examination requests</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1f\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">handling a request for a foreign field examination</span></span></a>.</div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">April 29, 2019</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; When to Request a Field Examination</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Claims processors may request field examinations for various reasons.&nbsp; These include, but are not limited to, the following:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">checking on the history of employment or social adjustment</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">substantiating the existence of disease or injury prior to enlistment</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">resolving the status of dependents or marital status</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">checking on a Veteran\u2019s ability to handle funds competently, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">handling an unresolvable conflict in the evidence of record.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Reference</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on field examinations, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000180507\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part IV, Subpart i, Chapter 2, Section E - Examinations in Special Situations\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000180507?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part IV, Subpart i, 2.E</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"height: 279px; width: 657px\" width=\"657\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; How to Request a Field Examination</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Request field examinations on <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><em>VA Form 21-3537a</em>, <em>Field Examination Request</em></a>, and include the following information in the field labeled&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>FACTS TO BE ESTABLISHED</em>:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the purpose of the field examination in language that is as specific and complete as circumstances permit</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the period of service on which the claim is based and the nature of the claim</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">a summary of the material facts with names and addresses of witnesses to be contacted and other known and probable sources of evidence, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">if entitlement depends on a marriage, the evidence of record pertaining to such marriage, and any prior marriages of the parties.&nbsp; (State whether or not further evidence as to the validity or termination of the marriage is needed.)</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">If evidence of record is conflicting, clearly state the conflict.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 232px; width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.c<a id=\"1c\" name=\"1c\">.</a>&nbsp; Handling Requests for Medical, Social, or Industrial History</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px; vertical-align: top\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 232px; width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">When requesting the medical, social, or industrial history of a Veteran or incapacitated child, include the period to be covered and as much of the following information as is known in the field labeled <em>FACTS TO BE ESTABLISHED</em> on <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><em>VA Form 21-3537a</em></a>:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">names and addresses of all physicians alleged to have provided treatment</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">period of treatment</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">names of physicians who have submitted statements indicating whether or not to contact them (Attach copies of all statements with<em> <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">VA Form 21-3537a</a></em>.)</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">names and addresses of employers and periods of employment</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">addresses of the Veteran or incapacitated person during the period.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.d<a id=\"1d\" name=\"1d\">.</a>&nbsp; Facilitating Identification of a Person Concerned in a Claim</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">To facilitate identification of a particular person concerned in a claim, provide in the field labeled <em>FACTS TO BE ESTABLISHED</em> on <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><em>VA Form 21-3537a</em></a>:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">the best possible leads to obtain information, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">all of the following information about the person:</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">full name</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">nickname and any other name by which the person was known</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">maiden and married surnames of women, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">date of birth.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.e<a id=\"1e\" name=\"1e\">.</a>&nbsp; Routing Field Examination Requests</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Follow the steps in the table below when routing a field examination request.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 498px\" summary=\"This is a step-action table.  Column 1 is the step number and column 2 provides instructions when routing a field examination request.\" width=\"498\">\t\t\t\t<thead>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Step</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 445px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Action</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</thead>\t\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 445px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Add a copy of <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><em>VA Form 21-3537a</em></a> to the claims folder.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">E-mail the original <a href=\"http://vbaw.vba.va.gov/bl/20/cio/20s5/forms/VBA-21-3537a-ARE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><em>VA Form 21-3537a</em></a> to the fiduciary hub having jurisdiction over the area where the primary beneficiary resides.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 445px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">When a completed field examination report is received, send the report to the activity (authorization or rating) that requested the examination.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t\t</table>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Reference</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information about jurisdiction and contact information for fiduciary hubs, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177976\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, Chapter 6, Section C - General Information on Incompetency and Fiduciary Cases\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177976?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, 6.C.1.d</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.v.1.E.1.f<a id=\"1f\" name=\"1f\">.</a>&nbsp; Handling a Request for a Foreign Field Examination</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Send a request for a foreign field examination to&nbsp;the fiduciary hub having jurisdiction based on the residence of the foreign beneficiary.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; The fiduciary hub will then forward the request directly to the appropriate embassy or consulate or to Veterans Affairs Canada.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>References</em></strong>: &nbsp;For more information on</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">fiduciary hubs of jurisdiction, see </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177976\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, Chapter 6, Section C - General Information on Incompetency and Fiduciary Cases\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177976?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, 6.C.1.d</a>, and</span></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">requests for field examinations in the Philippines, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177946\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart i, Chapter 4, Section C - Development of Philippine Claims\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177946?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart i, 4.C</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000178000\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 1, Section D  - Regional Office (RO) Hearings\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000178000?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000178002\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 2, Section A  - Evaluating a Pending Claim When a Veteran Returns to Active Duty\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000178002?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></p>",
